"""The 70 knowledge articles added in lab version 3 (catalog.py holds the original 50).

Same fields as catalog.KB_ARTICLES, plus the version 3 keys: "subcategory" and "tags" (what
tickets resolved with the article carry; the generator adds a product and version tag) and
"related" (spk_relatedarticles: two to four Published articles, never a Retired or Draft
one). "versions" maps a product field (rba, rra, rsg, rea) to the version prefixes the
article applies to; empty tiers or contracts mean all of them.

EXERCISE pairs added in version 3 (see the manifest "scenarios" section):
  KB0067 vs KB0062  same symptom, decided by Endpoint Agent version (7.4.0 or 7.3.x)
  KB0099 vs KB0142  repeated lockouts: a saved password, or a password spray attack
  KB0111 vs KB0112  printer offline: new address after a network change, or deep sleep
  KB0042 vs KB0054  site cannot reach head office: tunnel down, or tunnel up without traffic
  KB0033 vs KB0014  backups run into the morning: encryption on 5.x, or one upload stream on 4.x
  KB0102 and KB0128 are Draft articles: indexed, but never a confirmed fix.
"""

